 "notes": [
  "TOU per 吉发改价格〔2025〕11号 (2025-01-16; effective 2025-02-01, for 代理购电 users from 2025-04-01; cited in note 3 of every notice 2025-11..2026-10). Source: scanned official notice as published on 95598.cn (copy web/downloads/jilin_tou_2025_11.pdf). One rule all year: 高峰 8-10、16-21, 平 5-8、10-11、14-16、21-23, 低谷 0-5、11-14、23-24. No seasonal/holiday variant, no 深谷.",
  "高峰/低谷 = 平段 ± 55%, only the 上网电价/代理购电价格 floats (输配、系统运行费、基金、线损 do not). 尖峰 is no longer fixed: '灵活启动' by the grid with DRC approval, announced ad hoc – so no 尖峰 rule and the 尖峰 column is NULL.",
